{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1790896000, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "MCP NLP-to-Tool-Call Walkthrough (narration-paced)"}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1;36m== MCP NLP-to-Tool-Call Walkthrough ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.3, "o", "Six real prompt -> tool call -> result exchanges from this\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "project's TechZone sessions, via the scale-guinstall MCP server.\r\n"]
[18.8, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 1. Staging the cluster nodes ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.1, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"I do want to add two servers that will be protocol nodes.\r\n"]
[19.14, "o", "      172.16.0.21 zimabg1, 172.16.0.22 zimabg2.\"\r\n"]
[19.18, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_node_config(\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.22, "o", "\u001b[33m  toolkit=\"/usr/lpp/mmfs/6.0.1.1/ansible-toolkit/spectrumscale\",\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.245, "o", "\u001b[33m  nodes=[\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.27, "o", "\u001b[33m    {\"hostname\": \"zimabg1\", \"roles\": [\"protocol\", \"manager\"]},\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.295, "o", "\u001b[33m    {\"hostname\": \"zimabg2\", \"roles\": [\"protocol\", \"manager\"]}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.32, "o", "\u001b[33m  ],\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.345, "o", "\u001b[33m  dry_run=false\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.37, "o", "\u001b[33m)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.41, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.45, "o", "  Both nodes added with protocol + manager roles.\r\n"]
[19.48, "o", "  check_operation confirmed the real run's output.\r\n"]
[39.2, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 2. Disabling a known blocker mid-precheck ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.5, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"disable it for now\"\r\n"]
[39.54, "o", "      (in response to a callhome FATAL during precheck-install)\r\n"]
[39.58, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_callhome(\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.62, "o", "\u001b[33m  toolkit=\"/usr/lpp/mmfs/6.0.1.1/ansible-toolkit/spectrumscale\",\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.645, "o", "\u001b[33m  enable=false,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.67, "o", "\u001b[33m  dry_run=false\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.695, "o", "\u001b[33m)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.735, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.775, "o", "  [ INFO ] Disabling the callhome.\r\n"]
[39.805, "o", "  Two words became the exact right toolkit call.\r\n"]
[56.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 3. Resuming a long-running operation after a context gap ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.3, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"Check check_operation for the TechZone install run\r\n"]
[56.34, "o", "      (new u6kj9s3k environment).\"\r\n"]
[56.38, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mcheck_operation(\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.42, "o", "\u001b[33m  \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.445, "o", "\u001b[33m)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.485, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.525, "o", "  Large in-progress log saved to a file.\r\n"]
[56.555, "o", "  grep -E 'FATAL|ERROR|PLAY RECAP|successful|status'\r\n"]
[56.585, "o", "  only the relevant lines reported back.\r\n"]
[74.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 4. Deciding on cluster roles from a one-line ask ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[74.3, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"yes deploy it\"\r\n"]
[74.34, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_phase(\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[74.38, "o", "\u001b[33m  toolkit=\"/usr/lpp/mmfs/6.0.1.1/ansible-toolkit/spectrumscale\",\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[74.405, "o", "\u001b[33m  phase=\"deploy\",\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[74.43, "o", "\u001b[33m  dry_run=false\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[74.455, "o", "\u001b[33m)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[74.495, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[74.535, "o", "  The real, ~17-minute protocol deploy started.\r\n"]
[74.565, "o", "  No CLI syntax required from the user at any point.\r\n"]
[90.4, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 5. Enabling a new protocol on an already-running cluster ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[90.7, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"Test it live first on a fresh environment\" ...\r\n"]
[90.74, "o", "      \"the old environment is still there. feel free to\r\n"]
[90.78, "o", "      connect enable and capture it\"\r\n"]
[90.82, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_protocols_enable(\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[90.86, "o", "\u001b[33m  toolkit=<toolkit>,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[90.885, "o", "\u001b[33m  protocols=[\"s3\"],\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[90.91, "o", "\u001b[33m  dry_run=false\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[90.935, "o", "\u001b[33m)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[90.975, "o", "\u001b[33m... then start_phase(phase=\"precheck-deploy\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[91.015, "o", "\u001b[33m... then start_phase(phase=\"deploy\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[91.055, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[91.095, "o", "  S3 added cleanly. check_operation showed S3 ACTIVE\r\n"]
[91.125, "o", "  with NFS/SMB undisturbed.\r\n"]
[108.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 6. Verifying a phase that had never been run before ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[108.3, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"should we patch in pre and post checks for install\r\n"]
[108.34, "o", "      and deploy phases?\" ... \"Test live on u6kj9s3k first\"\r\n"]
[108.38, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_phase(\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[108.42, "o", "\u001b[33m  toolkit=<toolkit>, phase=\"postcheck-install\", dry_run=false\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[108.445, "o", "\u001b[33m)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[108.485, "o", "\u001b[33m... then start_phase(phase=\"postcheck-deploy\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[108.525, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[108.565, "o", "  Both phases ran clean on the first try -- real captured\r\n"]
[108.595, "o", "  output, not guessed/illustrative text.\r\n"]
[126.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== Closing ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[126.3, "o", "Plain language in, the smallest matching tool call out,\r\n"]
[126.6, "o", "a real result read back in kind. The person never has to\r\n"]
[126.9, "o", "know the tool exists, let alone what its parameters are called.\r\n"]
